{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "1b075f7550d80dd06e58b965ae101342acf789060a0673a8a84473a9208b3039", "ja": "ふたりはお姉ちゃん", "zh": "两人是姐姐", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d005fce26829764591a7912ae6516b96cd8cd6921e7fa77cae13a542d939174b", "ja": "例のおたよりへの答えが見つからない中、\n突如このみの妹かりんが劇場を訪れる。\nもしかしたら解決のきっかけになるかもと\n考えたこのみは、まつりを巻き込んで、\n自宅での食事会を決行！", "zh": "还没找到那个问题来信的答案时，\n这时，这赖的妹妹花凛突然来到了剧场。\n这赖觉得这或许会成为解决问题的契机，\n于是拉上茉莉，\n在家里举办了一场聚餐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e727608fa56646238f2e341db545bcedac5bb0c1c4830bbb4d59fcd239be1a7a", "ja": "（定期公演に向けて、レッスンが進んでいる。\nこのみさんとまつりの新曲も届いた……）", "zh": "（定期公演的练习正在顺利进行。\n琴美和茉莉的新歌也送到了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "37c0a2ee91dd3056b9d26699edb99f663423dee4481c0bc980dc333a405ff975", "ja": "（ただ例のおたよりに関しては、未だ手詰まりだ。\n少しでも、解決の糸口が見つかるといいんだけど……）", "zh": "（不过，关于那封来信，我至今还是毫无头绪。要是能找到哪怕一点解决问题的线索就好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "8533d277b2436dee6d1b95c895a4719af0e004a2dd30475a9d3d867028770e71", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまなのです。\nもう遅いから、劇場の戸締りは姫達にお任せなのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了呢。\n时间已经不早了，剧场的关门锁门就交给公主她们吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "96cbd79e2f70ee0fc8ef9401d19da809f76e96cb233fefeb889d59d72849fe18", "ja": "え、もうそんな時間か……じゃなくて、大丈夫だよ！\n戸締りだってプロデューサーの仕事だ。", "zh": "诶，已经这么晚了吗……不对，没关系！\n锁好剧场的门也是制作人的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "31e439bfe0c71723248f856bf80fbc4e538c89701d4579662f63f6372ee257d9", "ja": "もう、何言ってるの。3人でやればスピーディだし、\n分担してささっと済ませましょ？", "zh": "真是的，你在说什么呢。3个人一起做会更快，分工合作赶紧搞定吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0cc0077c88a6b563e23e9d9f0e6c9f8955d8a773906c63f2125ca124bfcbaf53", "ja": "（押し切られてしまった……。遅くなってしまったし、\n帰りはふたりを駅まで送って……ん？）", "zh": "（被她们说服了……已经这么晚了，回去的时候送她们两个到车站……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1006_null", "source_sha256": "fd13900c4f69537ddbf255ecbf5649eebf1986d3f90c30f5833fe96a0f62f198", "ja": "（うろうろ……）", "zh": "（走来走去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1007_null", "source_sha256": "63705a907db957df4506d8c15af2c6b3c3bb06eb9f98ea057c5db4a560da6698", "ja": "遅いな……。\nお姉ちゃん、まだ劇場にいるはずなのに……。", "zh": "真慢啊……。\n姐姐明明应该还在剧场里的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "36bea5b1dcd019c59c372ce93ece8a258bc6f297081543140d4f820606b357f7", "ja": "（知らない女性が、劇場の前を行ったり来たりしてる。\nこんな時間に、何の用事だろう？）", "zh": "（有个不认识的女性在剧场门前来回走动。这个时间来这里，是有什么事吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "b8f5bc72cc9f160d3a3045ad7824fd1683a9088d31a50a258fe74b48839ef70d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お待たせなのです。\n……どうかしたのです？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，让你久等了。\n……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "88fd094be6a4193722bb1b18cc928e2700ea680c04c6155a63c5c68ef73caeed", "ja": "ふたりとも、ちょっとそこにいてくれ。\n外に人がいるから、確認してくる。", "zh": "你们两个，先在那里待一会儿。\n外面有人，我去确认一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "7d57d130a3f9c5e8eaaa904d53562b43a988fafc5e393933ecd11ab5a79394e8", "ja": "外に人？　……あっ！？", "zh": "外面有人？……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "99e665d2597f17a6c686e551b054a1b8f8e323a4fb8e565068559999cbf85d25", "ja": "あの、すみません。\nうちの劇場に、何かご用ですか？", "zh": "那个，不好意思。\n请问您来我们剧场有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1013_null", "source_sha256": "3b9e3be4ac5b9c22363c462cb16ca20a5ffc70c10a23a8d1d94396fbcfc81a6e", "ja": "あ、いえ！　私はただ、姉を……\nあっ！　見つけた、お姉ちゃん！", "zh": "啊，不是！我只是想找姐姐……\n啊！找到了，姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "a1282cfd612de2a72847b9ef2e091e9b779413643dc5707078898d661f522390", "ja": "かりん！\nもう、迎えに来なくていいって言ったのに！", "zh": "花梨！\n都说了，不用来接我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "947ea1903ab3a3f088c183f2d7bf04a4bc297fc378efbb87fb1205cbda07c48b", "ja": "お姉ちゃん……ということは、\nこのみちゃんの妹さん！？", "zh": "姐姐……也就是说，是好美的妹妹！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "bc6cc2cfe167e785144fc8d5681c619f2145806e1cacb5ac6ac6bac364ece394", "ja": "あんまり似て……？　ううん。背が高くて\n大人っぽいけど、よく見ると似てるのです……？", "zh": "不太像……？不对。个子高高的，\n很有大人模样，但仔细一看其实很像呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "2887ca6930b145b3038cf1401d2c83e4cafe693920de05085fbcbb1ca4fa2132", "ja": "ちょっと、まつりちゃん！？\nそれはどういう意味なのっ。", "zh": "等等，茉莉！？\n你这话是什么意思呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7ca97eebf04ef3413e900811c586d05389f17f4c5de920e410779d55b7644b8c", "ja": "こ、これは失礼しました。お世話になっております。\n私、お姉さんのプロデュースを担当しております……。", "zh": "这、真是失礼了。您好，一直以来承蒙关照。我是负责您姐姐的制作人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1019_karin", "source_sha256": "cfd2e7a2c8275c87c959eb387ec0eadbc7ead7641539fc9015b042e6366f144a", "ja": "初めまして。馬場このみの妹で、馬場かりんです。\n姉がいつもお世話になっております。", "zh": "初次见面。我是马场木实的妹妹，马场花梨。\n姐姐平时承蒙您的照顾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "e695919aed4bea56fb54976dea5be7473de38d891e1947eafa43a7493f3d795b", "ja": "{$P$}、かりんも！\nそういうかしこまった挨拶とかいいから！", "zh": "{$P$}，花梨也不用这么拘谨地打招呼啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "4ac6dd0aeb1ecd8c3cacb92ec544c340a5b504b17c496b871ba858c424e2b546", "ja": "まったく、急に地元から遊びに来たと思ったら……。\n家で待ってなさいって言ったでしょ？", "zh": "真是的，亏我还以为你只是突然从老家跑来玩的……\n不是让你在家里老实待着了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1022_karin", "source_sha256": "4dabf443460815b3dce452edd0489a6f917722463ed13b5d47a11b0984087fcb", "ja": "だってお姉ちゃん、メッセージ送っても返事ないし。\n心配だったから、迎えに来ただけ。", "zh": "因为姐姐你发了消息也不回我。\n我只是担心你，才来接你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "56bd793bd3bd23c32bc3540c43972c207f30f2ae56c00af62915a88dc2ba9de3", "ja": "そうでしたか、すみません。\n公演前なので、打ち合わせが長引いてしまって。", "zh": "这样啊，对不起。\n因为演出前还有安排，商量得有点久了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c87e871a5c8c535887931422565f21aeae981ef0107ec13c49f3aab96d928266", "ja": "このみさん、まつりも。\n遅くなったし、車で送るよ。", "zh": "木实小姐，茉莉也一起。  \n已经很晚了，我开车送你们回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "451ba58aaf70059545aacf6a39e2ba9e149ddb283770e00f298fc188b63c2895", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとうなのです。\n荷物を取ってくるのです。このみちゃんも……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢你哦。\n茉莉去拿行李过来哦。木实也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "f0427a1d1f3b2c567b9b730397d5fd4c4e80018d03599eb6a6a1b09139247e1d", "ja": "このみちゃん？", "zh": "可爱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "4be74e40437fd5e69fa51c34273dbf5127e93ffe391446e6c72231e759d810bb", "ja": "ねえまつりちゃん、明日ってお休みよね。予定は？\n今日この後、何か用事はある？", "zh": "呐，まつ莉，明天休息吧？有什么安排吗？\n今天接下来还有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "f4dd66199663f86ed0ccc8704343acd9790a77441b1f7ef97342a4df2ec47a2f", "ja": "ほ？　姫は、特に予定はないのです。", "zh": "哦？公主接下来没有特别的安排哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "e24d264ce2dba6e6d99967e18519751d6f351e69aa1b1bef2726af518b633ac4", "ja": "なら、問題ないわね！\nまつりちゃん、今から私の家にいらっしゃい！", "zh": "那就没问题了！\n茉莉，现在就来我家吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1031_021mat", "source_sha256": "5412ab20bd84d1e7b7598423c18fdf9545757024ed76976c1176aa71738372f0", "ja": "……ほ？\nこのみちゃんの家に？　今から？　ほ？", "zh": "……哎？\n去木实同学家？现在去？哎？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "e09a47995d4cfa657302239201ab2cc6e0602a4f2fcddf4f406cc14e07480f9b", "ja": "ええ！　新曲のこと、もう少し話し合いたかったし……\n遅くなったついでですもの、お泊りしていかない？", "zh": "嗯！因为还想再商量一下新歌的事……既然都已经这么晚了，要不要留下来过夜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1033_karin", "source_sha256": "4b4bce005b3f71026fa5126ee2d539309bfdd1fdb83edb325071f66e61e2b357", "ja": "また始まった……。お姉ちゃんって強引だよね。\n迷惑だったら、断って大丈夫ですよ？", "zh": "又开始了……姐姐还真是强势呢。\n如果觉得困扰，拒绝她也没关系哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1034_021mat", "source_sha256": "620c8d6902890d1d217d569ee51df790c5d040ee0cb89f90f782f9f4f6a95228", "ja": "迷惑ではないのです……けど、\nせっかく妹さんが来てるのに……。", "zh": "并不是麻烦……只是，妹妹好不容易来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "eaa9cf1215382f0336fb25bd9d5427c8477cc3ecfdf8afd6f173558222278839", "ja": "あら、妹は気にしないで。\nどうせしょっちゅう来てるんだから、この子。", "zh": "哎呀，不用管我妹妹啦。\n反正这孩子也经常过来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1036_karin", "source_sha256": "8bbc7605424f6ee31da751f5ccd4af10546b2f0150e78304f0a1d82baabbb7b0", "ja": "まあ、それはそうだけど。\n私のことだったら、気にしないでください。", "zh": "话是这么说啦。\n如果是我的事，请不用放在心上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1037_039kon", "source_sha256": "ee332a5b5ce8549ba8b80a21c3d913f66602adf1d75396b14a50f8e6b05d7e4d", "ja": "そうと決まれば……{$P$}！\n途中に、スーパーあるでしょ？　あそこで降ろしてね！", "zh": "既然决定了……{$P$}！\n路上有家超市吧？到那里时让我们下车哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "6d6e7d65922b8434514279042ed649e0212fcbdb22b4a8365b136d8dc8220dbb", "ja": "ええ、構いませんよ。\nそれじゃ、車出してきますね。", "zh": "嗯，没问题。\n那我去把车开过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1039_p", "source_sha256": "a6fa945db2f22eb395d336acf6657d94df36218c64b604527543385c4a8bf199", "ja": "（このみさん、何か考えがあるみたいだな。\n……ここはひとまず、任せてみようか）", "zh": "（琴叶小姐好像有什么想法。\n……先暂时交给她试试吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1040_null", "source_sha256": "1f7bf2c79a13aba6a76026929b90db845b9c545fb5f9a94a8d4aa927c1ab11f7", "ja": "このみ宅、夕食後……", "zh": "这次在家吃晚饭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1041_karin", "source_sha256": "04e61aa8aac540e8af8e892595d659ae8d4039af643a01376e6ba6daf17c9856", "ja": "まつりさん。アイドルのお仕事って、\nそんなに忙しいんですか？", "zh": "茉莉小姐。当偶像的工作，\n真的有那么忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1042_karin", "source_sha256": "96f810c63c7c22edc32e64020e338c2189ef749cde3dd839aeb240e46c5e359a", "ja": "最近のお姉ちゃん、「忙しい」って言ってばかりで、\nちっとも連絡してこないんですよ。", "zh": "最近姐姐总是说\"很忙\"，\n一点消息都不给我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1043_021mat", "source_sha256": "3545f4cda1a182541d331f2b72ded1c71339ee69944c3b0b1b8cfd6eddf60068", "ja": "ほ？\n……このみちゃん、そうなのです？", "zh": "咦？\n……原来是这样吗，小此木？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1044_039kon", "source_sha256": "d6729f67ba14b2f202077150242ad301fbc850aa3cb7bceab9328dec4f4ddde2", "ja": "それは、年末年始があったからで……。私達の仕事は\n時間的に不規則だから、ちょっと連絡しづらかったの。", "zh": "那是因为正好赶上年末年初……我们的工作时间不太规律，所以有点不方便联系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1045_039kon", "source_sha256": "35b8a5610217832f1bd476e7d1ba821c4f6f13002a2490ec1c92bd47c8880987", "ja": "だからメッセージは送ったでしょ。それに、かりんが\n行きたいっていうから、初詣には付き合ったじゃない。", "zh": "所以我不是给你发过消息了吗。而且是因为果琳说想去，我才陪她一起去新年参拜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1046_karin", "source_sha256": "337763aac2b341c973aa9f9e3b7e308d1f17cd72248ad658ea99dff1d791750c", "ja": "あっ、それで思い出した！\nせっかく東京にいるんだし、初売りに行かなくちゃ♪", "zh": "啊，这么一说我想起来了！\n难得人在东京，一定要去新年首次促销♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1047_039kon", "source_sha256": "4e3679adbd31efe74e25f644d275e0bf8af68e19d0020a5d2b144a34b0ac3660", "ja": "初詣の次は初売り？\n都会に来たら、すぐはしゃぐんだから……。", "zh": "参拜神社之后就是逛新年促销吗？\n一到大城市就马上兴奋起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1048_karin", "source_sha256": "f77bdb1f91a3dbba6f0fb58b34bc6e6d8ff0f66bd66bc8bbeb3c679bbcb1c5ae", "ja": "まつりさんは、身長高いですよね。\nあっ、私と同じくらいかも？", "zh": "祭典小姐个子很高呢。\n啊，说不定和我差不多高？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1049_021mat", "source_sha256": "fe1f2b0f7f2d2d3e6c3c0f302b45ac89648cc13c728918bb0588adb67421fe2a", "ja": "そうかもしれないのです。", "zh": "也许是这样哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1050_karin", "source_sha256": "3869248f0ee9141a709be56f11cb546822d8f4e921457fe68cd96df879e42e04", "ja": "なら、まつりさんも一緒に行きましょう！　明日！\nそれで福袋を買って、わけっこしませんか？", "zh": "那我们明天也一起去吧，茉莉！  \n然后买福袋，再一起分着吃，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1051_021mat", "source_sha256": "3702cee8d1e03eeb2374dd3453c223c3e21165458b9c5aa1cf134f45eb8dab05", "ja": "わけっこ……。", "zh": "分着……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1052_karin", "source_sha256": "917392184d0576c75f508d39b18877ca2ee6324d5d9d5d89bc9e09a6cbb8a3e5", "ja": "だってお姉ちゃんとじゃ、サイズ的にできないし。\nね、いいアイディアだと思いません？", "zh": "毕竟要是和姐姐一起，按尺寸来说也做不到嘛。  \n你不觉得这是个好主意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1053_039kon", "source_sha256": "13de7cbd1711117fddc141da603cff16fc0c5f9ec2d3a9b0670464e13c829c09", "ja": "ちょっと、かりん？　まつりちゃん、\nかりんのワガママなんだから、聞かなくていいのよ。", "zh": "等等，花梨？小祭，这可是花梨任性的要求，不用听她的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1054_021mat", "source_sha256": "326081542645f82fa82a06bac06eed7457c65a0bef5325c3578aef7271888634", "ja": "ふっ……ふふふっ。", "zh": "呵……呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1055_039kon", "source_sha256": "d65ad27dd804b34b2cfe086cbd8463042fea9e5065b13b30d59df4a176adefd1", "ja": "まつりちゃん？", "zh": "茉莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1056_karin", "source_sha256": "70e19c216a85b06b04f92de1f5b0db647b508c65b7853efbd213917b2b1d4642", "ja": "まつりさん？　どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "茉莉小姐？你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1057_021mat", "source_sha256": "2828bacd709c5c7611d7eabe7574318630628bb9b90686e2737ad547d3f25635", "ja": "なんでもないのです。\n……わけっこ、とっても楽しそうなのです。", "zh": "没什么。  \n……一起分着，感觉特别开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1058_021mat", "source_sha256": "775bd21bb0786fcf9b48f82f0509a14714c6b9e4f4b80e8e41308414bffdce45", "ja": "けど、まつりが選ぶ服は、そー・きゅーと！なのです。\nかりんさん、それでもいいのです？", "zh": "不过，茉莉选的衣服可是超——可爱！卡琳小姐，那样也没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1059_karin", "source_sha256": "aebc40ad1962da4b6326a6587d86a67e385ad577f515e0e72ba653a7309a6654", "ja": "甘い系は、ポイントで使いますから！\n可愛すぎるのは、まつりさんにあげますね♪", "zh": "甜食类的我会用积分兑换！\n太可爱的就送给まつり小姐吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1060_039kon", "source_sha256": "e4e5d5bfec35aa598a37f74663f12d5b22a07a5a37c303b26bbf3e14d8bbb4a6", "ja": "勝手なこと言って……\nまつりちゃん、ほんと断っていいんだからね！", "zh": "净说些自作主张的话……\n小祭，你真的可以拒绝的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1061_karin", "source_sha256": "a5ab7c8c15ced5f9c549ed05f2c7d6fbc389237837e98f2c637c9be560ef05f4", "ja": "ふーんだ。お姉ちゃんのイジワル！　あーあ、\nまつりさんがお姉ちゃんだったら良かったな～。", "zh": "哼！姐姐你真坏！唉——\n要是茉莉姐姐是我姐姐就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1062_039kon", "source_sha256": "f6fe1faf2753ebc9b865184b6eff0bbad571cfaa57282245e1a4a39bcb102e04", "ja": "いや、あんたのほうがまつりちゃんより年上だから……\nそこは無理だから、自覚しなさい。", "zh": "可你比茉莉还要大吧……\n这一点根本不可能啦，你给我自觉点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1063_021mat", "source_sha256": "47eed77ce5eceabbc5cef6326cf8db20dcfb541973092f26a854f6abf5ef3eef", "ja": "ふふっ。……かりんさんは、\nお姉さんのことが本当に大好きなのですね？", "zh": "呵呵……香铃小姐是真的很喜欢姐姐呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1064_karin", "source_sha256": "6bad35dfe5e8401eaf082b65b6e1465ed84ea9fe68aaf9adbf64aba6104703ff", "ja": "ええっ！？　どこが！！？", "zh": "诶！？哪里像了！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1065_021mat", "source_sha256": "485e294c61d969a174b1ab96861eda38338ecc47da9ca94f2507b4bb8d0a5c32", "ja": "まつりも、こう見えてお姉ちゃんなのです。\n隠したってお見通しなのですよ。", "zh": "真也如现在这样，也是姐姐哦。\n就算你藏起来了，我也看得一清二楚哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1066_karin", "source_sha256": "2a2995913537ce49bd28ce4c80f9fede221f84178130d51adea6d778164830bd", "ja": "別に、そんなことは……うう。", "zh": "也不是那种事……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0265_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_05_1067_karin", "source_sha256": "900781c5fe8ee76c2ffec665ac1a69ba2b187edd6925e7b7495f84e0e0db1c97", "ja": "わ、私、コンビニ行ってきますね！", "zh": "我、我去趟便利店！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
